     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<div><div>Just to mention that if any of you are interested in submitting a guest post for <a href=\"http://r-bloggers.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r-bloggers.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792351371820000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ELCRQVYDqrZfW9qQpfDtH\">r-bloggers.com</a>, you are welcome to do so through this url:</div><div><a href=\"http://www.r-posts.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.r-posts.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792351371820000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2EqLl_NooaGDHh-ImiOcoG\">www.r-posts.com</a></div><div>and I&#39;ll approve your post.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Cheers,</div><div>T</div></div><div><br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br clear=\"all\"><div><div class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><br>----------------Contact Details:-------------------------------------------------------<br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:small\">Tal Galili, Ph.D. in Statistics</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:small\"></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:small\"><br></span></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Tal.G...@gmail.com</a><br><br></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"http://www.r-statistics.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.r-statistics.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792351371820000&amp;usg=AOvVaw21BBYscXye4cv9SZT17nLm\">www.r-statistics.com</a> (English)</div><div dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"http://www.biostatistics.co.il/\" style=\"font-size:12.8px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.biostatistics.co.il/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=17